## 3. Embedded System Diagrams

### 3.1 Container & Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

```mermaid
graph TD
    User([User]) -->|Interacts| UI[Vue / React UI Components]
    UI -->|Calls| Service[Calculation & Business Services]
    Service -->|Encrypts via WebCrypto| Crypto[AES-GCM / PBKDF2 Vault]
    Crypto -->|Persists Ciphertext| DB[(IndexedDB / LocalStorage)]
```

### 3.2 Sequence Diagram (Mermaid)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Component View
    participant Service as Service Engine
    participant Crypto as Web Crypto API
    participant Store as IndexedDB

    User->>UI: Enter Investment Inputs & Save
    UI->>Service: calculateProjections(inputs)
    Service-->>UI: Return Projection Data
    UI->>Crypto: encryptPayload(masterKey, payload)
    Crypto-->>UI: Ciphertext
    UI->>Store: saveEncrypted(ciphertext)
```
